{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factory 95 is a retro Windows inspired puzzle-automation game about making a slide show factory\u2026 in a slide show! Manage your space, make increasingly complex slides and worry about Y2K in this minimalistic factory builder. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/f0837530700b6f1871ac144f0953b80f.poster.avif?t=1765411133\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/f0837530700b6f1871ac144f0953b80f.webm?t=1765411133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/f0837530700b6f1871ac144f0953b80f.mp4?t=1765411133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a retro operating system as you complete requests for your clients. You\u2019ll need to juggle your emails and download new tools from the World Wide Web to expand your factory and earn company revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/a6b877a7e92a03225e3bea3f201c0d31.poster.avif?t=1765411133\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/a6b877a7e92a03225e3bea3f201c0d31.webm?t=1765411133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/a6b877a7e92a03225e3bea3f201c0d31.mp4?t=1765411133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your factories are built within a slideshow-making software, so you only have limited space to design systems and move resources. Send slides between pages and unlock a wide range of tools to build complex slides in a compact space.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/69ea8bf4f94b8a514a85f10039f8d408.poster.avif?t=1765411133\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/69ea8bf4f94b8a514a85f10039f8d408.webm?t=1765411133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/69ea8bf4f94b8a514a85f10039f8d408.mp4?t=1765411133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple game modes, and new advances in 16-bit colour there are limitless possible slides to create. Flex your graphic design muscles and earn that long-awaited promotion!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987250?t=1765411133","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/4186ae36b9be83cd6baf96a35e0330dcc177de14/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765411133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/2357a0f8f080e37c9dafdd6356fa31d977edca69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765411133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/2357a0f8f080e37c9dafdd6356fa31d977edca69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765411133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4128230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factory 95 is a retro Windows inspired puzzle-automation game about making a slide show factory\u2026 in a slide show! Manage your space, make increasingly com